WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Big Two: be first to empty your 13 cards.
You are West, holding the ♣3.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:16.998 line:0
The first play must include the ♣3:
click it, then press Play.

00:00:16.998 --> 00:00:23.998 line:0
South, East and North each beat it with a
higher single, going counterclockwise.

00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:33.998 line:0
North plays ♦7; West clicks ♦9 to beat it.
Match the card count and type, and play higher.

00:00:33.998 --> 00:00:41.998 line:0
Fast-forward: press Pass if you cannot beat it.
When all others pass, West leads again.

00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:50.748 line:0
On a lead you may play five cards: West picks
a full house and presses Play.

00:00:50.748 --> 00:00:55.997 line:0
South answers with four 2s and a 3:
four of a kind is a bomb and wins.

00:00:55.997 --> 00:01:05.997 line:0
Fast-forward: when nobody can beat a play,
its player leads again.

00:01:05.997 --> 00:01:15.000 line:0
West goes out first and wins; North, East and
South keep 9, 6 and 4 cards and score penalties.
